/p><p>Comfortable without that sinking foam</p><p>feeling, and the support feels natural and</p><p>balanced all night. No weird smells, no off-</p><p>gassing. It sleeps noticeably cooler, which</p><p>has made a real difference in how well we</p><p>rest.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="78be9bf5-acc6-402c-89d0-4b9bd0d351e4" class="r-12jetk5"><div data-rid="c2ae8076-d9c0-4799-b7a4-40fea97fe3d3" class="r-8lh56v"><div data-rid="f928e613-4f53-4a10-8e63-cd0bde0fb6e7" class="r-136ql0r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Jimmy S.</p></span></div><div data-rid="07e95375-127f-48cd-8722-5b2793919b0a" class="r-bhffiv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Verified buyer</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3e497d8f-856f-4a49-ae65-2f0bd58bb2f5" class="r-oc6rt9"><div data-rid="3c5d4591-e42b-4110-8601-628916233372" aria-current="true" aria-label="Go to slide 1" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-fixvcq r-1vbw2xg"></div><div data-rid="3c5d4591-e42b-4110-8601-628916233372" aria-current="false" aria-label="Go to slide 2" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-fixvcq"></div><div data-rid="3c5d4591-e42b-4110-8601-628916233372" aria-current="false" aria-label="Go to slide 3" role="button" tabindex="0" class="r-fixvcq"></div></div></div><button type="button" data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="nav-button" data-direction="next" aria-label="Next slide" data-rid="480db819-f2a3-47a5-a0f2-cec7e51e27c9" class="r-1qiwtv2"><div data-rid="0d5dd70c-97fd-449e-8bac-75e183bd1e17" class="r-5bgfgj"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-right" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline></svg></span></div></button></div></div></div><div data-rid="a89d2330-426f-4fa2-9cda-e2d6b0288da8" class="r-zoca7x"><div data-rid="652bc441-7c34-42a2-9b84-bed3fa6065dc" class="r-2ps715"><div data-rid="1c137838-1b6e-443e-ace7-f0e2d977957a" class="r-x2u3oc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Furnishing a whole house is a</p><p>big decision. We've made it a</p><p>reversible one.</p></span></div><div data-rid="17f73143-17cc-4e4d-bd71-634bfd3c4df4" class="r-1e2s6a9"><div data-rid="703da2a8-4c95-44c8-9f14-980ffa10220a" class="r-18glso9"><div data-rid="795016d9-5239-4f2e-966f-a60b38618cca" class="r-1rrreqr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100-night trial</p></span></div><div data-rid="42f40f73-1754-4017-8c6c-783e10390f2d" class="r-1lsxyea alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Sleep on every bed for 100 nights. There's a 30-night break- in period, because latex settles and so does your body. Between nights 31 and 100, return or exchange — free with store credit, or a $199 processing fee for a cash refund.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="29e281f1-8c2f-4333-9d08-af6c16aadd12" class="r-j47adh"><div data-rid="f6583ae6-8d29-4c54-ae4d-1b4fcf3c358d" class="r-npxncx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>30-year warranty</p></span></div><div data-rid="3d37947d-c325-4297-ae2d-91bba488acf6" class="r-bqgyba alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The industry replaces foam beds every seven to ten years. We warranty ours for thirty. That's the difference between furnishing your home once and furnishing it three times.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="84e14421-f8b1-4dbe-87ff-19a994eca541" class="r-1ita3mb"><div data-rid="b49d070e-6d6f-4e6c-9d3d-c320ef62f585" class="r-e4jo8y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Made in the USA</p></span></div><div data-rid="7a50d007-f6f8-4284-ac80-5215fe545c8b" class="r-34xdxy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every product is handcrafted in the USA and ships from our Georgia facility. Most orders arrive in about fourteen days.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="3aa35cd4-17c1-461d-841d-d898c7bb57a3" class="r-8tiqye"><div data-rid="7b30f6b1-cd74-49d7-b5cf-9697f8e44ea4" class="r-1ehp9nh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Free shipping</p></span></div><div data-rid="09f848c5-c396-42c6-b749-8ab50fbc922d" class="r-1q8ixg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Free across the contiguous 48 states. Alaska and Hawaii ship at a separate rate.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="547996bf-f295-4362-8eb8-c43f36413d88" class="r-1401cnf"><div data-rid="4e85358b-3106-4b9c-b2a0-dd5f161cdd3e" class="r-1rf0epp"><div data-rid="90bd4701-0327-4e20-82c6-c7eb65dbbf31" class="r-1grpc8j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>ACIMA</p></span></div><div data-rid="82135cba-5a74-4500-b30b-13b153977923" class="r-19tzb64 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Lease-to-own, high approval</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="ec103bb1-593d-4974-93cb-23a9c2fe9562" class="r-9npl4"><div data-rid="a4f59aac-ab7d-4d42-94a1-3d88882a5e89" class="r-1lgehok alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>HSA / FSA</p></span></div><div data-rid="7008807f-a6ce-4769-89bd-ccbb0b879368" class="r-1a9bpvg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Eligible through Truemed</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f8066e0f-cb24-4ad9-a655-abd26921b7af" class="r-69dsg9"><div data-rid="db896910-3073-4ba2-b603-3ecabca4b40b" class="r-1uzpqc5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>All major cards</p></span></div><div data-rid="cad33878-3058-430d-b593-d23631ad17b7" class="r-1mt23fl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Plus PayPal and Apple Pay</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d5e68ace-a65f-4a68-aad2-2f994a23dde0" class="r-la9ump"><div data-rid="aad05714-f29d-4a27-84d0-6633b0333cc3" class="r-1991ht3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Affirm & Shop Pay</p></span></div><div data-rid="9ad04052-5dbd-4934-b0f4-3c858c5b7793" class="r-1cipfqx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>0% financing options</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4f84cf74-54b4-4a93-bc36-09178cf411ba" class="r-c6c1vg"><div data-rid="bae6eebb-cd37-4b81-a1ee-8035bac2a003" class="r-6743qu"><div data-rid="61269715-4f0a-428b-a78e-5bb6936a1381" class="r-1wja2iz"><div data-rid="13102cfa-6ab3-4030-904a-4b4846973dac" class="r-1agsc6v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Spec'ing more than one home? That's a different conversation.</p></span></div><div data-rid="8cb1769f-a188-4cc5-8205-dace2fb7448c" class="r-55epb9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Non-toxic materials are one of the few upgrades a buyer can</p><p>actually feel on a walkthrough. If you're staging spec homes,</p><p>furnishing a development, or building a package for a design</p><p>client, we work at project scale.</p></span></div><div data-rid="f148d169-895b-41d8-8cba-57d02866569e" class="r-vz0ssd"><button data-rid="dce52e38-8c93-4926-8451-b01a39b5ab80" tabindex="0" class="text r-1jdbk6n alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="6cee20c1-8926-497a-9d41-12d6972cab11" class="r-6qg01f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Talk to the trade team</p></span></div></button></div></div><div data-rid="fca58558-f597-4697-9b74-7b90d3843ba1" class="r-12c5yum"><div data-rid="4821b9e5-4f97-4845-b626-28f859bcdcb8" class="r-ukrnd0"><div data-rid="43bfc92f-78f5-45ac-87da-df3409695166" class="r-yis04a"></div><div data-rid="951296c3-2a33-4074-a954-54941ca12ca3" class="r-jl8ifb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Trade pricing tiered by unit volume, quoted per project</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b7ca168c-3a34-4bd9-b1e3-1ce7d9495543" class="r-19kgb0b"><div data-rid="5b552c0d-b7c0-47fd-9b7c-aa6f333eb2b8" class="r-ewl3os"></div><div data-rid="a9eff702-7ad3-4a92-9328-5634fa01f5cc" class="r-16hutdd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Sales rep support</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="617893c6-022d-4782-98fb-561563b9995d" class="r-6etfjf"><div data-rid="eeb85ff6-cd99-47dd-be1e-0dd85ae44809" class="r-1cp7z4q"></div><div data-rid="846f00aa-d655-4ed4-9942-ab5bc36daea6" class="r-151hd7f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Delivery scheduled to your construction or staging timeline</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="155988da-9704-411f-9668-ccb7d8db2560" class="r-1as7bsz"><div data-rid="3dd92bc0-1e2e-4ff9-805e-4456f6b36d84" class="r-1bm91kc"></div><div data-rid="ce0eb233-6c88-43da-ab57-0ba27ef6094a" class="r-782mca alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>White glove support</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="ad4ba814-04a7-4aa3-9481-cb7428a8de58" class="r-1k4x6ef"><div data-rid="5396e934-c721-448b-92ff-66fe79834a81" class="r-nnazm2"></div><div data-rid="3578018d-4828-49e3-8801-299a9ada4cd0" class="r-1gkcjv3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Consistent SKUs across a development, with inventory held for&nbsp;<span style="color: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit; text-transform: inherit; background-color: transparent;">phased builds</span></p><p></p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="16153e10-3f40-484f-85d5-be3ee8abd8d9" class="r-20z16m"><div data-rid="6539023a-f75e-4d5a-9b70-59a5406b58b6" class="r-1iq5ljf"><div data-rid="45aad6a6-b048-482a-b6c4-63fb39a646c2" class="r-6kf7us alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The one purchase that's</p><p>easier before the boxes</p><p>arrive.</p></span></div><div data-rid="59ebfa57-d018-4322-9244-d573ecb0d0a5" class="r-ktqi1o"><div data-rid="a741b272-26fb-4636-809a-ddf372d6efe6" class="r-dxwo4y"><div data-rid="d00f0e2a-c947-455a-9ecb-1eaf510b4035" class="r-1v2gw3l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>One delivery, one day</p></span></div><div data-rid="dfa73947-32a3-45fe-b114-b6f629e6740d" class="r-bp3nz9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every bed in the house arrives together,</p><p>scheduled to your move-in date. Not four separate</p><p>deliveries across three weeks while you sleep on</p><p>an air mattress.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f8c26a64-4eda-4ef2-afba-1b71b7399931" class="r-hoybbq"><div data-rid="7fb1aa9f-2bf8-484f-85ab-cbeda908f883" class="r-19pec2v alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Volume pricing needs one order</p></span></div><div data-rid="af098c29-14ee-4944-89ce-c3ff456dfbc4" class="r-1n72xuj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Buy the primary bedroom now and the guest room</p><p>in March and you've paid retail twice. The tiers</p><p>apply within a single order.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="34ea10f0-2cb6-43bb-9b7d-b0546ba0d417" class="r-1wc06n4"><div data-rid="407a7919-639e-48ad-b6ed-636006461bdb" class="r-rfuobn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Lead time is real</p></span></div><div data-rid="d651f10e-4a4f-46d5-a8bd-64c026a82a2c" class="r-1k40d1a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Handcrafted in the USA, roughly fourteen days</p><p>from order to arrival. Start now and it's handled.</p><p>Start the week of the move and you're buying</p><p>whatever's in stock at a big-box store — which is</p><p>exactly how houses end up full of foam.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="be893687-03df-4163-a1f6-0a2a025c0279" class="r-145o54c"><div data-rid="f7eb0656-fb7c-4494-b4c7-515685c02e5e" class="r-g79oqu"><div data-rid="9f54f5c4-6fc3-41c9-9463-b4ee54f0093d" class="r-896aob alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Three steps, about five minutes of your time.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ac15473d-f3b6-45c8-b478-b95718bfc2c8" class="r-z4pwdc"><div data-rid="bbb91cc2-4e14-4ce2-b012-b859663349c6" class="r-15fimp2"><div data-rid="29bd82a9-10b9-4b26-a3c1-b613588bad96" class="r-18s1w4e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>1</p></span></div><div data-rid="72cac0cf-4fba-4c88-8898-1903d1030be7" class="r-9qii9r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tell us your rooms</p></span></div><div data-rid="f67b7010-46d8-4041-94b4-629ce61f0c22" class="r-akatln alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Bedroom count, sizes if you know them, your</p><p>target move-in date. Rough numbers are fine —</p><p>most people are still finalising the floorplan.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="034d5987-3d2a-4878-be50-02f3faaa4880" class="r-1d8tryf"><div data-rid="98183319-713d-48ca-b856-165ea5c052d7" class="r-1qdgznb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2</p></span></div><div data-rid="731b25ba-7960-4fd1-9f97-3a0f5d7aae44" class="r-du3jw6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We build the quote</p></span></div><div data-rid="c3cc4566-d33e-4bc1-8e09-389e115cae45" class="r-15bduiy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>A specialist assembles your whole-home package</p><p>with volume pricing applied, plus bedding and</p><p>base options. You'll have it within one business</p><p>day.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="727bbad2-6af7-41c1-b990-73d45abdcf4f" class="r-1fhlp1d"><div data-rid="4c91c5c9-46e7-4d05-9447-736c6b4358fe" class="r-1176pbz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3</p></span></div><div data-rid="c3fabff0-4252-4659-8097-1ce6a350753c" class="r-1clfl1k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We deliver to your date</p></span></div><div data-rid="80c24f46-6235-4498-8879-6b05090ee32d" class="r-1ufbfct alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Approve the quote and we schedule everything to</p><p>land on or before move-in day. One delivery, every</p><p>room, done.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="64dfc2ad-4e0d-47cd-936e-7d897d269e1c" class="r-1z03u85"><div data-rid="f8535db0-ff2b-418e-93a7-ed0dfd103311" class="r-1vi6p3e"><div data-rid="7d63b2ed-99d3-4151-bda2-1bf5dd7372d1" class="r-5j6c0e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Questions we get from new-build buyers</p></span></div><div data-rid="60db6cf4-b6c9-44ff-b11f-7e4e3e4a1644" class="r-1ypx6l1" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c35b37a8-343b-4f06-a360-603d8fdc382f" class="r-1a65mel" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4660f606-f946-4dff-8778-59abbf4c6aaf" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1u970hq"><div data-rid="5b807009-eb2b-4a83-ba8d-e1540981f2ac" class="r-kot85 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I'm still six months out from closing. Is it too early?</p></span></div><div data-rid="61ef1256-1f04-4f8a-97f9-3f46d79960f4" class="r-10giaph" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3br2:"><div data-rid="7c99f53f-8b27-4101-9064-114813d2c332" class="r-dctr4p"><div data-rid="1d29726e-18f7-4fa6-91c5-014fb58e9aac" class="r-wxirn2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No — it's the ideal time. We build the quote now and hold your pricing, then schedule delivery to whatever date your builder lands on. Timelines move, and we plan for that.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4d862e16-0ca5-4273-a988-b1b6d09ca19f" class="r-19jwo6y" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="20ce32e5-0ad6-4a97-b7ac-5909d1ad8e6d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-cmbsjs"><div data-rid="fa3c0295-f904-4b75-8f92-542e545d99d4" class="r-j376nl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I don't know my exact bedroom sizes yet.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ae9391a3-8f80-4078-9e0a-604eeeb1d9d4" class="r-hdbo6f" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5br2:"><div data-rid="e7be569c-3ee4-46f9-8355-6c202add48cf" class="r-ub6qv8"><div data-rid="b60ff55c-4f02-4ffb-ad86-bd92d9578ecd" class="r-1ykx714 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>That's fine. Give us the room count and we'll build a quote around the most common configuration, then adjust once your floorplan is final.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a52007a8-1cfa-4080-a668-135ca3105dc4" class="r-1ohro0k" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e43cd3cf-e68a-454d-a518-34b6a32f255e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-181qnro"><div data-rid="e565a0cc-08f9-4316-b1c1-6c63203d1863" class="r-1kja14f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How much cheaper is a multi-unit order, really?</p></span></div><div data-rid="ebfefeb1-d0f4-4564-b6f9-18b63c6aa32b" class="r-5qfs48" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R7br2:"><div data-rid="65bad606-178f-4df4-b065-9798caac55e4" class="r-1eewrk6"><div data-rid="213f45bf-fd34-477f-987e-1eca7bc93504" class="r-1oh970i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It depends on the count and the mix of mattresses, bases and bedding, which is why it's quoted rather than listed. Bundles alone save 30% or more, and volume pricing stacks from the second mattress onward.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="27c9114c-b062-491f-87fb-2b17426bdc75" class="r-joymz8" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="815be39c-876f-4af2-aa48-55cc5889e6da" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R9br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1wo6lqd"><div data-rid="badef9e4-42e6-4841-91fa-2eae43674f04" class="r-1oc6i1n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I finance a whole-home order?</p></span></div><div data-rid="45674d24-4b32-4516-8c37-5594d49d7c9d" class="r-1r0hiur" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R9br2:"><div data-rid="8650d3af-b218-42a9-8f2f-3ab0ba22d258" class="r-1m62775"><div data-rid="4819b0a1-117b-4900-8d75-7b4bada3df71" class="r-mylgny alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Affirm and Shop Pay Installments offer 0% options, ACIMA offers lease-to-own with a high approval rate, and HSA or FSA funds may be usable through our Truemed partnership.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="24f037aa-f73c-4bc1-beff-18d404e40139" class="r-gzno08" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ef4d2cb1-96a1-4c35-a2a1-8a2aec5dc185" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-p6ab90"><div data-rid="cbd14c40-79e8-4791-9008-a69266ac5aec" class="r-ppc369 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if one bed turns out to be wrong for the room?</p></span></div><div data-rid="abaf8be9-1053-494f-b035-c6126c47aca6" class="r-1nwl9lw" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rbbr2:"><div data-rid="84a4130a-ac70-40fe-80e0-454c414d1a17" class="r-1tjpqcf"><div data-rid="aa9f28b5-9210-4818-96f3-d19836f88128" class="r-1qwldzq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The 100-night trial applies to each mattress independently. If the guest room should have had the firm rather than the pillow top, we exchange that one.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8d2c502b-c5f1-4d05-9d4e-5add34531f9f" class="r-1q45qd9" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="974374e1-29a6-4f11-b0e4-3c1954daeb40" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16ffl8c"><div data-rid="d886d349-2ff9-44f7-9c39-77393a5e5416" class="r-a1mi1e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How is this different from other organic mattresses?</p></span></div><div data-rid="be3d9872-5c89-486f-95d8-de8dec8b1912" class="r-1c1ytnq" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rdbr2:"><div data-rid="8a56b041-3b08-4020-b9a2-8e00bef4eb69" class="r-zdla2i"><div data-rid="c32eebdc-608e-457c-b932-0729650a3780" class="r-1lxtntp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most are organic on the surface — the cover — while the core is still synthetic foam and adhesive. Ours is organic cotton, organic wool and natural latex the whole way through, hand-tufted with no glue, no polyurethane foam, no synthetic flame retardants, no fiberglass and no VOC off-gassing.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="215f67fe-73c3-4885-9aa3-c6fb9ab158de" class="r-1bx6tnc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f3496cdc-b621-4039-9258-a663adf5be2c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rfbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1d9wida"><div data-rid="0c8c5c29-1499-4938-b665-02fafc79ab95" class="r-1l72ces alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you work with builders and interior designers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="11a3a52b-5994-4502-86c1-72b8b22ffd8a" class="r-1wj6udu" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rfbr2:"><div data-rid="33e3741f-18c6-4740-a0c2-29d3e85187a1" class="r-167rzsq"><div data-rid="a460cfd3-cf54-4794-b5e9-3bf563a4dec5" class="r-vjgah7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Choose your role in the form below and you'll be routed to the trade team for project-scale pricing.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f1769844-2e6c-4b33-9317-d1ee0c201e10" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="mai" tabindex="-1" id="mai" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-115i5vt"><div data-rid="085fd91f-7120-48f0-8547-37af3a9002ac" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="m" tabin